### ToothCloud Appointment API Tests

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:3001/api/health

###

### Create Appointment - Valid Request
POST http://localhost:3001/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "phone": "123-456-7890",
  "date": "2025-06-15",
  "time": "10:00 AM",
  "practitioner": "Dr. Sarah Johnson - General Dentistry",
  "serviceType": "General Checkup",
  "message": "First time patient, no specific concerns"
}

###

### Create Appointment - Invalid Request (Missing Required Fields)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "invalid-email",
  "phone": "",
  "date": "",
  "time": "",
  "practitioner": "",
  "serviceType": ""
}

###

### Create Appointment - Past Date
POST http://localhost:3001/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Smith",
  "email": "jane.smith@example.com",
  "phone": "987-654-3210",
  "date": "2025-06-10",
  "time": "2:00 PM",
  "practitioner": "Dr. Michael Chen - Orthodontics",
  "serviceType": "Orthodontic Consultation",
  "message": "Interested in braces"
}

###

### Create Appointment - Conflict Test (Same date, time, practitioner)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bob Wilson",
  "email": "bob.wilson@example.com",
  "phone": "555-123-4567",
  "date": "2025-06-15",
  "time": "10:00 AM",
  "practitioner": "Dr. Sarah Johnson - General Dentistry",
  "serviceType": "Teeth Cleaning",
  "message": "Regular cleaning appointment"
}

###

### Get All Appointments
GET http://localhost:3001/api/appointments

###

### Get Available Time Slots
GET http://localhost:3001/api/appointments/available-slots?date=2025-06-15&practitioner=Dr. Sarah Johnson - General Dentistry

###

### Get Appointments by Date Range
GET http://localhost:3001/api/appointments/date-range?startDate=2025-06-15&endDate=2025-06-20

###

### Update Appointment Status (Replace {appointment-id} with actual ID)
PATCH http://localhost:3001/api/appointments/{appointment-id}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "confirmed"
}

###

### Get Appointment by ID (Replace {appointment-id} with actual ID)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/appointments/{appointment-id}

###

### Delete Appointment (Replace {appointment-id} with actual ID)
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/appointments/{appointment-id}
